  "solution": {
    "text": "Number of all five digit sequences (telephone numbers) is <math><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />When no digit is repeated, then&nbsp;<math><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30240</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;The required number wen atleast one digit is repeated&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>100000</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>30240</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>69760</mn></math>"
  }
